{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鍾柔美（Yumi）日前在社交平台宣布好消息，考獲駕照一年多的她，分享多張在車廂內的自拍照，興奮向大家宣布自己終於正式甩「P」，擺脫暫准駕駛執照的限制，順利成為正式駕駛者。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">照片中可見，近乎以素顏上陣的鍾柔美狀態極佳，身穿簡約灰色T恤坐在駕駛座上，手持「P」牌標誌做出各種搞怪表情，最後更鬆手將「P」牌掉棄，雀躍之情溢於言表。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9f4c3880-f25d-4407-aa6a-2e96f75f6bad.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20268UytBlS4CX1786416795.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9f4c3880-f25d-4407-aa6a-2e96f75f6bad.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e7e256b2-68e1-487d-9ee9-9eef0ff482d5.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026aql3nwJQr51786416795.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e7e256b2-68e1-487d-9ee9-9eef0ff482d5.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大批粉絲與網民紛紛留言道賀：「恭喜 Yumi 正式畢業！」、「以後路上多了一位靚女車手」、「幾時可以坐你車去兜風？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T08:06:58.127203+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}